{"scene_id": "s01392", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s01392.fountain", "heading": "INT. PROBATE COURT - CHAMBERS - DAY", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "JUDGE ELEANOR VANDERHOOF", "names": ["JUDGE ELEANOR VANDERHOOF", "ELEANOR"], "gender": "f", "first": 5, "spoke": 3}, {"id": 1, "name": "BRAXTON WHITCOMBE", "names": ["BRAXTON WHITCOMBE", "BRAXTON"], "gender": "?", "first": 6, "spoke": 2}, {"id": 2, "name": "CLEMENTINE WHITCOMBE-ADAMS", "names": ["CLEMENTINE WHITCOMBE-ADAMS", "CLEMENTINE"], "gender": "?", "first": 6, "spoke": 2}, {"id": 3, "name": "HORACE PINKNEY", "names": ["HORACE PINKNEY", "HORACE"], "gender": "?", "first": 6, "spoke": 1}, {"id": 4, "name": "ODETTE LAURENT", "names": ["ODETTE LAURENT"], "gender": "?", "first": 6, "spoke": 0}, {"id": 5, "name": "FINN HARGROVE", "names": ["FINN HARGROVE"], "gender": "?", "first": 6, "spoke": 0}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. PROBATE COURT - CHAMBERS - DAY", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "A paneled room that smells of lemon polish and old paper.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Bookshelves climb to the ceiling, heavy with leather volumes no one has opened in decades.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "A radiator knocks in the corner.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Through a tall window, bare maples shiver against a gray sky.", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "JUDGE ELEANOR VANDERHOOF, 70s, sits behind a walnut desk with her glasses pushed to the top of her head.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Before her, the five heirs of the Whitcombe estate perch on mismatched chairs: the eldest, BRAXTON WHITCOMBE, 50s, in a tailored suit; his sister, CLEMENTINE WHITCOMBE-ADAMS, 40s, twisting a rope of pearls; the lawyer, HORACE PINKNEY, 60s, sweating in tweed; a cousin, ODETTE LAURENT, 30s, silent; and a young man, FINN HARGROVE, 20s, who has just been revealed as the old man's secret son.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "The will is clear.", "name": "ELEANOR", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Which one?", "name": "BRAXTON", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "The last one.", "name": "ELEANOR", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "There was no last one.", "name": "CLEMENTINE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "There was.", "name": "HORACE", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "^ There was not!", "name": "BRAXTON", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "^ Horace, you assured us!", "name": "CLEMENTINE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "The judge raises one finger.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "The room obeys.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Mr. Pinkney. Produce it.", "name": "ELEANOR", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "He opens his briefcase with trembling hands and draws out a single cream envelope.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Odette, in the corner, finally looks up.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "Her eyes meet Finn's.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "She gives the faintest nod.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}]}